Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't look very welcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am he who was entrusted to guard this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the time being,\Nyou may call me Number 48.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Number 48?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been so long. I'm delighted to be able to go against someone so capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have run out of luck\Nby coming up against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not think ill of me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.89,0:00:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you, don't think ill of me for being the kid who defeated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.15,0:01:03.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice. You move well for your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.49,0:01:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.82,0:01:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should respond when\Nasked who I am, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is Number 66.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although, that's just what they call me at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Number 66?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:17.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do have my own, proper name as well,\Nbut if you heard it, you'd be\Nso surprised you'd wet yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when I finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His reflexes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.12,0:01:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the same kind of armored body as Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:14.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.69,0:02:25.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, you're hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:10.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surprising. You've done well to realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I spar against someone like you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could tell by\Nthe way you moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:21.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone like me\Nin the outside world, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It bugs me to think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that there's some idiot besides me who \Nthought of bonding a soul to a suit of armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Allow me to reintroduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.28,0:04:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Number 48" is the label I had as a condemned prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:43.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Officially, I'm supposed to have been executed two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A condemned prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means that, sure enough, there's a connection
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.51,0:04:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}between the 5th Laboratory here and the prison next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I had a flesh-and-blood body,\NI was called "The Slicer."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was a mass murderer,\Nwho caused many public disturbances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nowadays, my skills have been called upon,\Nand I am the immortal watchdog over this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you're not immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your bloodseal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The iron within the blood is attuned with the metal of your armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that is what keeps your soul\Nbound to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that seal is broken, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:34.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It appears that after all this time,\NI've encountered someone with a little backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This should prove to be an interesting fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your weak spot\Nhas been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're going to surrender, now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:42.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the type who seeks a little tension in battle, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then...\NEn garde!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that? Just now there was something strange in my shoulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:39.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since it's less heavy,\Nits strength has dropped as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so make sure you don't do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to finish this quickly, or I'm in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like a monkey, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I've had\Nsuch responsive prey. I'm delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, judging by your wound and your exhaustion,\Nthe end of this battle is in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see, \Nmy body knows no fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surrender. Right now, my companion is disposing of your partner outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't rely on him to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, this companion\Nof yours—is he strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's strong although not to\Nthe same extent as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.76,0:07:41.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:44.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case,\NI don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been sparring with him\Nfor a long time, but I've never won.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:07:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold still so I can chop you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You miserable behemoth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hurt you\Nfor all you're worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking a shoulder roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone and done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My head fell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:46.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to certain circumstances, I've wound up with this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't tell who I am, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:57.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you guys catching me,\NI was made a condemned criminal, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Number 66 was my label on death row.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I still had a flesh-and-blood body, the name people called me by was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the serial killer, Barry the Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barry the Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barry? You mean, from back then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:23.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After being caught and executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:32.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've come back from the depths of hell \Nto take revenge against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't "you don't say" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People get surprised when\Nan executed prisoner is still alive, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's more, when a beheaded suit of armor still moves around,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you should be more like "Gyaah!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or like "Waah!" or like "What's the deal with your body?!" or like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gyaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:53.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the deal\Nwith your body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:56.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's awful. You'll hurt my feelings, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:59.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you a fellow\Nexecuted prisoner too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:01.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm no criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, now that I know, this fight is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know what your weakness is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:12.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I destroy the bloodseal within\Nthat armor someplace, you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same goes for you too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you don't know\Nwhere my bloodseal is, do you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you don't know\Nwhere mine is, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this point,\NI'll just have to slice you up and\Nfind out where your bloodseal is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:33.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with him? Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B Block and C Block have both turned up nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:40.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must still be in the area somewhere! Find him, whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's pretty bold to be staging an attack on a military facility like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, why is Scar so preoccupied with coming after Edward-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:56.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, where are\Nthe Elric brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:11:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, well, you see...\NIt's like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:04.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're acting suspiciously!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Armstrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With your authorization,\Ncould I have the forces here relocate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers are currently\Nat the Central 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:23.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NYour movements are growing poorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you through already, Pee-Wee?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:12:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling too small to even see, who doesn't even make for a good target?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least your spirits are high.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I wonder how much longer that will last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not the Automail again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:39.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hold me in too low a regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think you could best me\Nfrom a spear's distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've done well to have fought this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, you have reached your limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Resign yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no way you can win now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:12.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting that I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.89,0:13:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.39,0:13:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did you get in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All is fair in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NMy bloodseal is not yet broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.47,0:13:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If your soul is in your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then once I cut it off,\Nyour body is just a hunk of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to\Nfight you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.06,0:14:08.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, there's something I wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.32,0:14:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've come to investigate this place, there is little else you could be after.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case,\Nwe can cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:21.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me\Neverything you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, beaten dogs\Ndon't get to show me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll break your bloodseal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...\Nimpossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.27,0:14:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One set of armor isn't necessarily limited to one soul, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:15:00.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The body has a bloodseal as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay,\Nmy older brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just barely,\Nmy younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Younger brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I forget to mention that?\NThe mass murderer known as the Slicer...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was a pair of mass-murdering brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An independent head and body, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:22.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That reeks of foul play!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:27.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was it that said\N"All is fair in battle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you injure my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to pay for that, Pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestima—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:43.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I'm not giving you any time to transmute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm losing too much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm seriously starting to get lightheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:10.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:13.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I going to die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.07,0:16:19.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dammit!\N{\i1}If I die here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.53,0:16:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I die here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who's going to return\NAl back to normal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you \Ndo that to my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can do that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't give you\Nenough time to transmute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just remembered that nasty fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He didn't perform transmutation,\N{\i1}just the decomposition technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone and done it, you dirty brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I deserve better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn. Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:34.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As much as it pains me,\Nwe've lost, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that there's\Nactually three of you brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:42.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:45.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time, you truly are victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:49.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, this time,\Ntell me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, destroy us at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:54.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:57.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing remains for the defeated except death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:17:59.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is our rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph! You're far too generous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:12.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With our bodies like this,\Ncan you possibly call us "someone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:14.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you to {\i1}destroy{\i0} us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.15,0:18:20.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I were to concede that you aren't people,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd... I'd have to concede\Nthat my younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, is not a person either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your younger brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:18:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hasn't this gone on long enough, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:19:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm concerned about Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That pipsqueak alchemist\Nis your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.53,0:19:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother gets angry\Nif you mention his height.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:11.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it was your brother who\Ngave you that armored form!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. He risked\Nhis life to transmute me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:27.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.13,0:19:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, how rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brotherly love is so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:38.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it {\i1}is{\i0} false affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,False?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! False love!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not so!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother genuinely loves me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a perfectly naïve fellow you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suppose you were an imitation. What would you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suppose your personality and memories
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were implanted in you as it suited\Nyour brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That just isn't so!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:09.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am, without question, a person, whose name is Alphonse Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:15.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a spirit—something indefinite,\Nwhich cannot be seen with the eye—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:18.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,how are you to prove that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your brother—and the people around you—\Ncould all be deceiving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...\NThat's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother is a person,\Nand you guys are people too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:38.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want...\Nto kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:48.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amusing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quite amusing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For as long as I can remember,\Nmy brother and I have made our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:21:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by stealing, breaking, killing, and being looked down upon as fiends and brutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.85,0:21:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that we've abandoned our bodies, to say nothing of our hearts and minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to think that, for the first time,\Nwe're being treated as people...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a person!\NI'm Alphonse Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any proof that you ever really existed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be...\NFor all of it to be false...\NThat couldn't possibly be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:41.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something... I've been meaning to say to you for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.89,0:21:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(2420)}but I've been too scared...\Nand I haven't been able to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was Brother trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.69,0:21:51.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was it that\Nhe was too scared to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:53.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,too scared to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.57,0:21:55.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.26,0:23:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.05,0:23:44.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 21: "The Red Glow"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's a color to people's lives...\Nthat's probably the color it would be.
